review:
Excellent Rosso blended from 5 grape varieties (Montepulciano, Sangiovese; Negroamaro; Primitivo & Malvasia Nero) from two different wine regions; 
Color is deep purple red, aromas of black cherry, prune, cassis, chocolate, vanilla and leather; 
Full bodied; ripe tannins and a strong acidic backbone; mellow and soft attack on the palate with  spicy-sweet element; well crafted wine with a pleasant long finish (4.5 ⭐️)

